#. Tutorial lesson 1, shown in the bottom bar (two lines, up to about 85 characters a line)
msgid ""
"Tilt your device to move around the map and head for the exit tile.\n"
"The gauge in the corner shows your tilt: dashed ring to walk, solid ring to run."
msgstr ""
"Claon do ghléas le bogadh agus déan ar an tíl amach.\n"
"Taispeánann an tomhas sa chúinne an claonadh: fáinne briste siúl, fáinne iomlán rith."

#. Tutorial lesson 2
msgid ""
"Stepping on this tile will reverse the controls.\n"
"Step on another and they go back to normal."
msgstr ""
"Má sheasann tú ar an tíl seo, cuirfear na rialtáin droim ar ais.\n"
"Seas ar cheann eile agus beidh siad mar a bhí arís."

#. Tutorial lesson 3
msgid ""
"Stepping on this tile will make Map Man disappear.\n"
"Don't worry, after a few moves he will show up again."
msgstr ""
"Má sheasann tú ar an tíl seo, imeoidh Map Man as radharc.\n"
"Ná bí buartha, beidh sé le feiceáil arís tar éis cúpla bogadh."

#. Tutorial lesson 4
msgid ""
"Stepping on this tile will cause Map Man to get stuck.\n"
"Shake your device to free him and get moving again."
msgstr ""
"Má sheasann tú ar an tíl seo, rachaidh Map Man i sáinn.\n"
"Croith do ghléas lena shaoradh agus bog leat arís."

#. Tutorial lesson 5
msgid ""
"Watch out for bonus points,\n"
"although you may have to go out of your way to get them."
msgstr ""
"Bí ag faire amach do phointí bónais,\n"
"cé go mb'fhéidir go gcaithfeá dul as do bhealach lena bhfáil"

#. Tutorial lesson 6
msgid ""
"Also keep an eye out for extra lives,\n"
"but take care as they will take you\n"
"even more off course than bonus points."
msgstr ""
"Coinnigh súil amach freisin do bheathaí breise,\n"
"ach bí cúramach, tabharfaidh siad\n"
"níos faide fós as do bhealach thú ná na pointí bónais"

#. Tutorial lesson 7
msgid "Be careful of the poison tiles: if you step on them you will lose a life."
msgstr "Seachain na tíleanna nimhe: má sheasann tú orthu, caillfidh tú beatha."

#. Tutorial lesson 8
msgid ""
"These tiles crumble away once you step off them.\n"
"There is no going back, so plan the way ahead."
msgstr ""
"Titeann na tíleanna seo as a chéile nuair a fhágann tú iad.\n"
"Níl aon dul siar, mar sin pleanáil an bealach romhat."

#. Tutorial lesson 9
msgid ""
"Spikes rise and fall on a beat, with a warning first.\n"
"Wait for them to drop, then cross before they rise again."
msgstr ""
"Éiríonn agus titeann na spíce ar bhuille, le rabhadh ar dtús.\n"
"Fan go dtitfidh siad, ansin trasnaigh sula n-éiríonn siad arís."

#. Tutorial lesson 9
msgid ""
"Ice sends you sliding until a plain tile or the edge stops you.\n"
"You can't steer on it, so line up before you set off."
msgstr ""
"Sleamhnaíonn tú ar an oighear go stopann gnáth-thíl nó an ciumhais thú.\n"
"Ní féidir stiúradh air, mar sin déan réidh sula n-imíonn tú."

#. Tutorial lesson 10
msgid "These tiles will give you extra time or cost you time. You will get bonus points for time left on the clock when you finish each level."
msgstr "Tabharfaidh na tíleanna seo am breise duit nó bainfidh siad am díot. Gheobhaidh tú pointí bónais as an am a bheidh fágtha ar an gclog ag deireadh gach leibhéil."

#. Tutorial lesson 11
msgid "These tiles cause other tiles to disappear and reappear. When the tiles are hidden you can still step on them so remember where they are."
msgstr "Cuireann na tíleanna seo tíleanna eile as radharc agus ar ais arís. Is féidir seasamh fós ar na tíleanna atá i bhfolach, mar sin cuimhnigh cá bhfuil siad."

#. Tutorial lesson 12
msgid "Every so often you'll come across a checkpoint. Each time you reach a checkpoint you can restart from there instead of going back to the beginning."
msgstr "Anois is arís tiocfaidh tú ar sheicphointe. Gach uair a shroicheann tú seicphointe is féidir leat atosú as sin in áit dul ar ais go dtí an tús."

#. Tutorial lesson 13
msgid "Tap the screen during play to pause. Holding your device a new way? Tap the corner gauge to set that as the new centre."
msgstr "Tapáil an scáileán le linn imeartha chun sos a ghlacadh. Ag coinneáil do ghléis ar bhealach nua? Tapáil an tomhas sa chúinne chun lár nua a shocrú."

#. Tutorial lesson 14
msgid "You're all set, head for the exit to start the game. Have fun!"
msgstr "Tá tú réidh anois, déan ar an mbealach amach chun an cluiche a thosú. Bain sult as!"

